        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo with up to 12 bots, or connect a controller to enable local multiplayer with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/1c967016c40996b52d3e5560dbbbcb69.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1560 height=642 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7 Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/75fae72a2818c9b446834abe7b44eba6.poster.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/75fae72a2818c9b446834abe7b44eba6.webm?t=1767651410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag - </strong>Fight for a single flag and return it to the capture zone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Practice - </strong>Compete for the most target hits or play solo and hunt for a 5x hit combo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Pickup - </strong>Smash your opponent into pixels and rush to collect them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Point - </strong>Reach the control points and secure them for 25 points each. Progress is faster in Hard difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orb - </strong>Hit the orb into the goal for 10 points. The next goal line respawns on the opposite side of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss - </strong>Defeat the boss by depleting their health meter with multiple stomps. They can evade attacks using a special teleport ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puck - </strong>Eliminate opponents using only the puck. Includes 8 powerups with special abilities and streak multipliers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/4c6b2bf1f2b128c9e0006447c625ad9a.poster.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/4c6b2bf1f2b128c9e0006447c625ad9a.webm?t=1767651410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Particle Scatter - </strong>Break into pixels to evade stomps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puck - </strong>Throw a puck to stun your opponent; press down to drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Time - </strong>Go half speed at any time, with no limits.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/522ed69d5727d4e887de50350029119f.poster.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/522ed69d5727d4e887de50350029119f.webm?t=1767651410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Side - </strong>The home map with a simple and straightforward layout. Half city, half countryside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle - </strong>A quiet castle on the river, designed for flag fortification.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowy Day - </strong>Cozy city suburb featuring a hockey rink mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooftop - </strong>A busy street separates an expanding business district.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yacht - </strong>Ahoy! Battle on the deck of a moonlit yacht. Equip the scuba mask for a fast getaway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moon Base</strong> - Explore the underground moon facility or float across the surface in low gravity.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Player Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect a controller and add a second player to the game.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo with up to 12 bots, or connect a controller to enable local multiplayer with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/1c967016c40996b52d3e5560dbbbcb69.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1560 height=642 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7 Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/75fae72a2818c9b446834abe7b44eba6.poster.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/75fae72a2818c9b446834abe7b44eba6.webm?t=1767651410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag - </strong>Fight for a single flag and return it to the capture zone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Practice - </strong>Compete for the most target hits or play solo and hunt for a 5x hit combo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Pickup - </strong>Smash your opponent into pixels and rush to collect them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Point - </strong>Reach the control points and secure them for 25 points each. Progress is faster in Hard difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orb - </strong>Hit the orb into the goal for 10 points. The next goal line respawns on the opposite side of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss - </strong>Defeat the boss by depleting their health meter with multiple stomps. They can evade attacks using a special teleport ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puck - </strong>Eliminate opponents using only the puck. Includes 8 powerups with special abilities and streak multipliers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/4c6b2bf1f2b128c9e0006447c625ad9a.poster.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/4c6b2bf1f2b128c9e0006447c625ad9a.webm?t=1767651410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Particle Scatter - </strong>Break into pixels to evade stomps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puck - </strong>Throw a puck to stun your opponent; press down to drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Time - </strong>Go half speed at any time, with no limits.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/522ed69d5727d4e887de50350029119f.poster.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/522ed69d5727d4e887de50350029119f.webm?t=1767651410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Side - </strong>The home map with a simple and straightforward layout. Half city, half countryside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle - </strong>A quiet castle on the river, designed for flag fortification.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowy Day - </strong>Cozy city suburb featuring a hockey rink mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooftop - </strong>A busy street separates an expanding business district.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yacht - </strong>Ahoy! Battle on the deck of a moonlit yacht. Equip the scuba mask for a fast getaway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moon Base</strong> - Explore the underground moon facility or float across the surface in low gravity.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Player Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect a controller and add a second player to the game.</p>",
